# KIDAMEgebeya — production environment template.
# All values are supplied by Vercel (Project Settings → Environment Variables).
# Do NOT put real secrets here; this file exists only to document them.
#
# --- REQUIRED ---
# DATABASE_URL
#    Postgres connection string. Local dev uses a local Postgres; production
#    should use a hosted one (e.g. Neon) — the app accepts it as-is:
#    postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db?sslmode=require
#
# JWT_SECRET
#    Long random string used to sign auth tokens:
#    openssl rand -hex 32
#
# ADMIN_PASSWORD
#    Password for the /admin panel (defaults to 'admin123' if unset).
#
# --- EMAIL (verification & password reset) ---
# RESEND_API_KEY
#    Key from https://resend.com. Without it, emails are only written to the
#    local dev outbox and customers never receive verification links.
#
# RESEND_FROM
#    Sender shown on outgoing mail, e.g. "KIDAMEgebeya <no-reply@yourdomain.com>"
#    Must match a verified domain in Resend, or use the sandbox sender
#    "KIDAMEgebeya <onboarding@resend.dev>".
#
# After pulling with `vercel env pull`, values land in .env.production.local
# (gitignored). Restart the dev server after changing any of these.